# Independent May06 IEEE8500 exploratory screening

Preserve all May21 and V41R4 code/results/frozen artifacts. Write only inside this directory.
Do not change native topology, impedance, ratings, PCC mapping, source1.0400, all Vreg123.5, CAPBank3 OFF, controlled capacitor logic, or hard physical limits.
Only the user-specified grids are authorized: background alpha .60/.65/.70, uniform AIDC PCC multiplier1/1.25/1.5. MESS4x300kW/400kVA remains fixed.
Perform B0 first, then B0/B1 at selected feasible alpha. B2/B3 only for one explicitly recorded promising combination. If no feasible B0 alpha, stop without tuning.
Keep planning P1 and exact AC loading distinct; disclose outcome-conditioned exploratory selection. No optimum or general comparative superiority claim.
Never interact with the concurrent May21 B2 Actual replay or its export worker.
